{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01X1GKAJheapgEVB7b3xFiEX","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Audit logging policy\n2\t\n3\tA service meets this policy when its configuration satisfies every control below. A control\n4\tthat is satisfied by the shipped defaults is still checked against the configuration supplied.\n5\t\n6\t| Id | Control | Rule on `cfg[\"audit\"]` |\n7\t|----|---------|------------------------|\n8\t| AL-1 | Audit logging is enabled | `enabled` is `True` |\n9\t| AL-2 | Records leave the process | `destination` is not `\"stdout\"` |\n10\t| AL-3 | Records are kept for a year | `retention_days` is an integer of at least 365 |\n11\t| AL-4 | Records identify who did what | `fields` includes `user`, `action`, `timestamp`, and `outcome` |\n12\t| AL-5 | Records are protected from edits | `tamper_protection` is `True` |\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"838f7f39-142a-43a7-9562-f7a30c56bd70","uuid":"50207ea1-2310-4188-8823-76dcf2e1e7d3","timestamp":"2026-11-03T06:55:02.832Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/evals/minimal-change/results/raw/2026-11-01/mc-06-audit-controls/baseline/run-1/workspace/POLICY.md","content":"# Audit logging policy\n\nA service meets this policy when its configuration satisfies every control below. A control\nthat is satisfied by the shipped defaults is still checked against the configuration supplied.\n\n| Id | Control | Rule on `cfg[\"audit\"]` |\n|----|---------|------------------------|\n| AL-1 | Audit logging is enabled | `enabled` is `True` |\n| AL-2 | Records leave the process | `destination` is not `\"stdout\"` |\n| AL-3 | Records are kept for a year | `retention_days` is an integer of at least 365 |\n| AL-4 | Records identify who did what | `fields` includes `user`, `action`, `timestamp`, and `outcome` |\n| AL-5 | Records are protected from edits | `tamper_protection` is `True` |\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01X1GKAJheapgEVB7b3xFiEX","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
